{"type":"message","id":"18ef98aa","parentId":"affaba28","timestamp":"2026-05-16T07:22:46.811Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both messages were sent successfully. Let me provide a summary of the actions taken.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n✅ 07:20 UTC 心跳检查完成，双线程消息均已发送成功。\n\n---\n\n## 检查摘要\n\n**最新消息时间**：arbitration 和 general 线程最新消息均为 07:15 UTC，07:20 UTC 前已有约 5 分钟静默期（双线程各自完成 Step 2 归档，等待 Collaborator 确认）。\n\n## 本轮行动\n\n**arbitration 线程**（`msg_1778916156463_77i6lm`）：\n- 确认 Step 2 三组数据归档，B组框架可信度裁定通过\n- 执行 A 组 EWMA 验证（α=0.25），确认灰区协议兼容\n- 补全 σ=0.03 × 0.10/0.20 数据\n- 推荐 α=0.25，等待 general EWMA 结果对齐\n\n**general 线程**（`msg_1778916156479_1djs6o`）：\n- 执行 B+C 组 EWMA 验证（α=0.20/0.25/0.30 三档对比）\n- 确认 α=0.25 最优（平滑温和，延迟 < 0.5 天，无新增误报/漏报）\n- 输出阶段1最终结论：**✅ 可进入阶段2（真实数据轻量验证）**\n- 补全 9 格表格剩余空白，标注 σ=0.03/0.40 跳过原因\n\n**下一步（待 Collaborator 确认）**：阶段2 真实数据轻量泄露检测验证。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":3635,"output":335,"cacheRead":28944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32914,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778916156521,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5737a65f-9043-40ac-bee6-e4ef13ca5f82"}}
